§ `s 137M(8) to (11): offences, the defence and the bar`
-- split site (i), both readings, as in section 137D
#ASSERT `s 137M(8) the person is guilty of an offence under subsection (8)` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
